 "remarks": "Experience sophisticated downtown living at The Classic, one of Stamford's premier luxury condominium residences. This desirable 5th-floor corner end unit offers abundant natural light, expansive windows, and an inviting layout designed for comfortable living and effortless entertaining. Featuring two bedrooms and two full baths, the residence boasts generous living spaces, a private balcony, and flexibility for a home office or dining area. The spacious primary suite offers an en-suite bath with a walk in custom closet, while the second bedroom is ideal for guests or a home office. Enjoy in-unit laundry and exceptional resort-style amenities, including a 24-hour concierge, heated indoor pool, fitness center, beautifully updated resident lounge, rooftop terrace, private dog park, and secure garage parking. Perfectly situated in the heart of vibrant downtown Stamford, just steps from restaurants, shopping, theaters, entertainment, and Mill River Park. With easy access to Metro-North and I-95, this prime location offers the perfect blend of luxury, convenience, and effortless, maintenance-free living. An exceptional opportunity to enjoy the best of downtown Stamford!",
